  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Sw 1300 PUBLIC GRANTS FOR LANDFILL AND INCINERATOR CLOSURE\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 149-M:7, RSA 149-M:9, RSA 149-M:41-50\n\nRevision Note:\n\nDocument #8459, effective 10-28-05, readopted with amendments, renumbered, and redesignated former Chapter Env-Wm 3000 as Env-Sw 1300, pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05. The source notes for each section of Env-Sw 1300 identify the former subtitle Env-Wm and number for the respective rule prior to Document #8459.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1300.html"
